  "problem": "Consider the finite region $R$ in the $xyz$-space, given by\n\n$$\nR=\\{(x,y,z)\\,:\\,1\\le x\\le 2,\\,\\frac{1}{x}\\le y\\le \\frac{2}{x},\\,\\frac{1}{xy}\\le z\\le \\frac{2}{xy}\\}.\n$$\n\nBy performing the change of variables\n\n$$\nu=x,\\,v=xy,\\,w=xyz,\n$$\n\nthe triple integral\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}\\,{e}^{xyz}\\,dV\n$$\n\ncan be written in terms of $u,$ $v,$ and $w$ as",
